lding up? "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["After last night... after Gideon’s attack?"]},{"code":221,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[1,"Act 3/8",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":222,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Celina Headshot",0,0,2,"Celina"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["We’re... doing alright, all things considered. "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["But I... I saw the strangest things."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Celina Headshot",0,0,2,"Celina"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["The man who... rescued me. The one who killed "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Gideon... Caelan. I saw him... appear out of "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["thin air."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Serith Headshot",0,0,2,"Serith"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Caelan? You must be mistaken. It was dark "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["down in the tunnels under the house. You were "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["frightened, disoriented... you probably just "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["imagined it."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Celina Headshot",0,0,2,"Celina"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["It wasn’t just that... When Gideon saw "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Caelan, he changed. He seemed to recognize "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["him. He... he looked sad. He even apologized "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["to him before he died."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Serith’s hand twitches slightly, a faint shadow crossing "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["his expression, though he quickly masks it and continues "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["his work."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Serith Headshot",0,0,2,"Serith"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Gideon... apologizing? Don’t read too much "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["into it. He was a disturbed, deranged man. "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["His ramblings and gestures mean little in "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["the end."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Celina frowns, her unease deepening. The smoke from the "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["vials curls around them like a quiet witness, and the "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["weight of the previous night presses against her chest."]},{"code":221,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[1,"Act 3/9",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":222,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Serith Headshot",0,0,2,"Serith"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Celina, we’re not done yet. There’s one final "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["task, and it’s the most important of all."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Celina Headshot",0,0,2,"Celina"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["One final task...? What is it?"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Serith Headshot",0,0,2,"Serith"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["East of here is an Orc camp. You’ll need to "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["go there. Gain their trust and help us secure "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["something important. The rest... Varric will "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["explain when you meet him."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Celina Headshot",0,0,2,"Celina"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Varric? I’m supposed to work with a "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["mercenary... can we really trust him?"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Serith Headshot",0,0,2,"Serith"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["He’s good at what he does. You can trust him — "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["just follow his lead once you meet him. He's"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["waiting for you on the East side of town."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Celina Headshot",0,0,2,"Celina"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["And... Liam? Can you make sure he’s safe "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["while I do this?"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Serith Headshot",0,0,2,"Serith"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["He’ll be fed and watched over. "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Don’t worry — he’ll live."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Celina Headshot",0,0,2,"Celina"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Alright... I’ll do it. But first... I need "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["to say goodbye to Liam."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Serith Headshot",0,0,2,"Serith"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Very well. Once that’s done, go find Varric."]},{"code":221,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[1]},{"code":222,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":0,"indent":0,"parameters":[]}],"moveFrequency":3,"moveRoute":{"list":[{"code":0,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":true,"skippable":false,"wait":false},"moveSpeed":3,"moveType":0,"priorityType":0,"stepAnime":false,"through":false,"trigger":1,"walkAnime":true},{"conditions":{"actorId":1,"actorValid":false,"itemId":1,"itemValid":false,"selfSwitchCh":"A","selfSwitchValid":false,"switch1Id":149,"switch1Valid":true,"switch2Id":1,"switch2Valid":false,"variableId":1,"variableValid":false,"variableValue":0},"directionFix":false,"image":{"characterIndex":0,"characterName":"","direction":2,"pattern":0,"tileId":0},"list":[{"code":0,"indent":0,"parameters":[]}],"moveFrequency":3,"moveRoute":{"list":[{"code":0,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":true,"skippable":false,"wait":false},"moveSpeed":3,"moveType":0,"priorityType":0,"stepAnime":false,"through":false,"trigger":0,"walkAnime":true}],"x":11,"y":4},
